t. ... () Additional arguments.","code":""},{"path":"https://r-xla.github.io/xlamisc/reference/shape.html","id":"value","dir":"Reference","previous_headings":"","what":"Value","title":"Shape — shape","text":"(integer()) shape tensor.","code":""},{"path":"https://r-xla.github.io/xlamisc/reference/xlamisc-package.html","id":null,"dir":"Reference","previous_headings":"","what":"xlamisc: Helper Functions for 'anvl' — xlamisc-package","title":"xlamisc: Helper Functions for 'anvl' — xlamisc-package","text":"Frequently used generics helper functions used 'anvl' companion packages 'stablehlo' 'pjrt'. Comes S3 generics query tensors (shape, data type, device) convert R arrays raw vectors, well enum-style class tensor element types. package also supersedes package 'tengen'.","code":""},{"path":[]},{"path":"https://r-xla.github.io/xlamisc/reference/xlamisc-package.html","id":"author","dir":"Reference","previous_headings":"","what":"Author","title":"xlamisc: Helper Functions for 'anvl' — xlamisc-package","text":"Maintainer: Sebastian Fischer seb.fischer@tutamail.com (ORCID) Authors: Sebastian Fischer seb.fischer@tutamail.com (ORCID) Daniel Falbel daniel@posit.co (ORCID)","code":""},{"path":"https://r-xla.github.io/xlamisc/news/index.html","id":"xlamisc-050","dir":"Changelog","previous_headings":"","what":"xlamisc 0.5.0","title":"xlamisc 0.5.0","text":"breaking: xlamisc now contains former tengen package: tensor generics (shape(), dtype(), device(), as_array(), as_raw(), naxes(), nelts()) DataType enum helpers. Use xlamisc:: instead tengen::. breaking: removed LRUCache, get_dims(), without(), seq_len0(), seq_along0(), shapevec_repr(), shapevec_reprs(), new_list_of(), format_bib() cite_bib(). ones still use now live packages use .","code":""},{"path":"https://r-xla.github.io/xlamisc/news/index.html","id":"xlamisc-041","dir":"Changelog","previous_headings":"","what":"xlamisc 0.4.1","title":"xlamisc 0.4.1","text":"new_list_of() longer causes R CMD check report “visible global function definition ‘validator’” packages store returned constructors.","code":""},{"path":"https://r-xla.github.io/xlamisc/news/index.html","id":"xlamisc-040","dir":"Changelog","previous_headings":"","what":"xlamisc 0.4.0","title":"xlamisc 0.4.0","text":"cite_bib() now lists authors, e.g. \"& B (Year)\" \"et al. (Year)\". Minimum required R version now 4.3.0.","code":""},{"path":"https://r-xla.github.io/xlamisc/news/index.html","id":"xlamisc-030","dir":"Changelog","previous_headings":"","what":"xlamisc 0.3.0","title":"xlamisc 0.3.0","text":"Fix Rd formatting new_list_of() longer checks class elements due performance costs.","code":""},{"path":"https://r-xla.github.io/xlamisc/news/index.html","id":"xlamisc-020","dir":"Changelog","previous_headings":"","what":"xlamisc 0.2.0","title":"xlamisc 0.2.0","text":"Added shapevec_repr() shapevec_reprs() formatting shape vectors. Added without() removing elements vector. Added format_bib() formatting bibliography entries.","code":""},{"path":"https://r-xla.github.io/xlamisc/news/index.html","id":"xlamisc-010","dir":"Changelog","previous_headings":"","what":"xlamisc 0.1.0","title":"xlamisc 0.1.0","text":"Initial release","code":""}]
